WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.000
The bakery opens at six.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.800
First the dough rests
for one hour.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.350
Flour &amp; water &lt;and&gt; a pinch of salt.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.000
The crème brûlée is ready at noon.

5
00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:05.950
Bread rolls
cost 40 cents
each.

6
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:03.500
See you tomorrow morning.
